  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Discover coastal comfort at Grayling Grace in Inlet Beach. This free-standing home offers modern design, spacious living areas, and coastal charm — perfect for families or groups seeking a peaceful beach retreat.<br><br>Primary renter must be at least 25 years of age. Guests may be asked to present their IDs upon arrival or anytime during their stay. Do not rent this unit for another party. The primary renter must be staying in the unit.<br><br>About the Vacation Rental Unit:<br><br>Welcome to Grayling Grace, a 3-bedroom, 2½-bathroom home offering both comfort and style. The open-concept living area features high ceilings, abundant natural light, and a fully equipped kitchen with granite countertops, stainless steel appliances, and a large island ideal for gatherings.<br><br>Relax in the primary suite with a king bed and private ensuite bathroom. Upstairs, you'll also find a washer and dryer conveniently located next to the master bedroom. The second floor includes a private balcony, while the backyard offers a patio with seating and a grill — perfect for unwinding after a day at the beach.<br><br>This 3-bedroom, 2½-bathroom vacation rental features:<br>Master Bedroom: King Bed with ensuite bathroom<br>Primary Guest Bedroom: Queen bed<br>3rd Bedroom: Two Twin Beds<br>Common Area Sleeping Arrangements: Pull-out couch<br>Guests will have access to 2 full bathrooms plus one half-bath!<br>Maximum Guest Occupancy: 8 Guests (Please note that children under the age of two years still count toward the maximum guest occupancy.)<br><br>Parking: <br><br>Two cars are allowed in the driveway. Additional parking is available by the mailboxes. No street parking is permitted.<br><br>About the Community/Property:<br><br>You've lucked out when staying within this picturesque community of Inlet Beach, which offers easy access to a variety of attractions. Enjoy the nearby pristine beaches, perfect for sunbathing, swimming, and water sports. Explore the scenic parks and nature trails, such as Camp Helen State Park and Lake Powell, ideal for hiking and picnicking. The property is also conveniently close to popular shopping and dining destinations at 30Avenue and Pier Park, offering a mix of boutique shops, restaurants, and entertainment options. With its prime location, this home provides the perfect blend of relaxation and adventure.<br><br>Beach Access: <br><br>The nearest access is Inlet Beach Regional Access, about a 2–3-minute drive from the property. This access offers parking, restrooms, and seasonal lifeguards. Located at the end of South Orange Street, about 200 yards south of US Hwy 98, it's the largest county access with three dune walkovers and 117 parking spaces.<br><br>A short half-mile walk east leads to Camp Helen State Park and Lake Powell, with opportunities for kayaking, paddleboarding, and exploring local reefs teeming with marine life.<br><br>Quiet hours within this community: 8pm – 8am.<br><br>Other details to note: <br><br>Trash days are Tuesdays and Fridays. The trash bin is located inside the gate in the backyard. Please take the trash can out the afternoon/evening before pickup. After pickup has occurred, make sure the can is returned to its appropriate location.<br><br>For the security of our guests and the safety of our home, there is an external security camera located at this vacation rental. One external camera is located above the front door.<br><br>Upon booking, you'll receive timely communications about your trip. Access to your professionally cleaned and sanitized home is also convenient with our custom keyless locks. And, if you need anything before, during or after your stay, our local team is ready to help!<br><br>Please be aware that there will be NO refunds for Wi-Fi issues as it's not guaranteed. If reliable Wi-Fi is a must, you are welcome to bring your own internet hotspot.<br><br>Non-negotiable rules: No Smoking or Vaping, No Events or Parties, No Firearms. Quiet hours are from 10pm to 7am (unless posted signage indicates otherwise).",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
